        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orjooga geenyea Yosefu gaweay Misri ghwasha booga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwayiiy Yakobo gideaba gwanda ng'eanyiida Misri booga, gwayeesha orjoagaaschi, “Ghwasaan anda goong'ulayi geat?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, naayiinyi gideaba gwanda ng'eanyiida Misri Booga; aweayeena ak goosheayneasa booga aba hoowa, ak abeeda geaghuyi, ak ea meemeewi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweay orju damanamughuush bea geenyea Yosefu ng'eanyiida Misri ghwasha booga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mwanung' Yakobo gawa Benjamini was orjeeda geenyea Yosefu goodeayi orjooga ghaamwat, aba gideaba ghoawal gideaba gajiidu gabussa ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghapka orjooga Israeli ghwasha booga, nea goodeana suuk, aba gideaba gwanda geejeeda ng'eanyiida Ganaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu abeeda niny sugoocheanda haw ambal ng'eanyiida; ak niny ea siida shaayda booga aba heeda buuneesean bea muunda ng'eanyiida. Hean ghwahidu orjooga geenyea Yosefu, ak gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi nea gabuy iheeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwadaa Yosefu orjooga ghaamwat, ak ghwanal, ak ghwanung' gawuurji rabasta nea iissa goobaloola nyarasta. Gwayeesha, “Agooga gooleabu ng'eanyiida yeenu?” Ghwalamda saawa ak gwayeesha, “Geeleabu ng'eanyiida Ganaani, eashaaha booga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanal Yosefu orjooga ghaamwat, nea saawa ea mwanala Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoapkaat Yosefu giirgweatka ghayi argweatiisa saawa; ak gwayeesha, “Agooga goowooschi fuga gheang'da, ghoapkaanyi adaaha healuumeeda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda saawa ak gwayeesha, “Manda, ng'utamiideanyu, soomjoagaagu ghapka ghwasha booga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseasa geewooschi orjoospa siyagi, aseasa geewooschi fuga miyaas, soomjoagaagu mii fuga buwa gheang'da.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha saawa, “Manda, ghoapkaanyi adaaha healuumeeda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Aseasa soomjoagaagu, geewooschi orju damaniyeenya, was orjoospa ghwaanagi mida ng'eanyiida Ganaani; ak ging'ulayi, orjeeda mwanang' askweareani gwandeawa bwaabwa, ak ea manda nuut.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yosefu saawa, “Asi nuwuurji gidaanyaashti gideaba agooga goowooschi fuga gheang'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aba sareani gajeesikteaweegwa: asi ghaayaaji habeawooda aba gheawunga Farao, asi majabeawana hiji ea eaghus ea nihidu hiji orjeeda mwanang' bea giyeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oocheakta orjeenagi aba jeedeang'wa, ak gweadu orjeeda geamadu, nea agooga gajoopiidana ghealooniga ak abeeda geesikteawa ng'asheegeagwa, eadaaha ea goorugu huumwa; amasa abeeda aba gheawunga Farao, aba huumwa goowooschi fuga gheang'da.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayiin sean ghealooniga eawooji samwagu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata eawooji samwagu gwayeesha Yosefu saawa, “Asina ng'asheanji ak gajaghuuha, aba gideaba geawooschi siida awali gheang'da ASEETA: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyoowooschi fuga miyaas, ghoanung'waadi goobiida orjeanagi ghealooniga, ak abeeda gaweay suurja ghwaat booga gealgeagwa bearji jalooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gooyeanean orjeeda geamadu mwanang'; ak abeeda geesikteawa ng'asheegeagwa, ak abeeda ea majameewa.” Ak gwasindunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaba nih eesha niirja, “Aba huumwa siitiinyi aba badayda orjeeda giyeanya, ak ea sidaayi sawanadeeda haw aba gurooroadaanyi, damanda musaneasa weeta ak ea meeleeysiina iit; ak ghoah gisinyasi ghamneawa sawanadeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Rubeni ak gwayeesha saawa, “Neada ghayi ea mearukuneegwa gideaba adoanyaschi riing'eeda aba badayda baleanda? Ak ea mooleeysiiniit. Ak ghamneawa ghwahidu waldeayda foojeandaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea majeeng'na gideaba Yosefu ghwanal saawa, aba gideaba gwanda dageascheeda nyaawa siida roopiida ng'asheega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanung'usa Yosefu heeda saawa ak gooyeawda; ak gabiigu ak goobalool saawa. Ak gageanu Simeoni ak ghwarat aba madeanyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orjooga geenyea Yosefu gabiikta Ganaani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Yosefu oanyiida mushoodaka nyaawa booga, ak gaba siisi oayiinyi lapiyeadaanyi badayda mushoataanyi, ak ghoatawji hamita naweeda. Nih gida sisissa saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoasari digeeniga booga nyaawa, ak ghang'eatng'eat gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gootin siyagi aba jeenyaawa mushoataanyi aba heechea gwalla ghoadaw digeadaanyi gichea ghwaak, ghwadaah lapiyeadaanyi aba ghuuta mushoataanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha orjooga ghaamwat, “Lapiyeedeanyu siikghuumu; sukwa gwanda ghuuta mushooteanyu!” Hean ghahamng'eanyi gurooruunatka nyaawa, ng'ata gwayameesiinyi nea gwayi, “Nih naaha ng'asheanji simaneasa ASEETEAN?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwahidu heeda ghwaan was Yakobo aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani, gwarukusa ng'asheega sean bussa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida was ng'utamiida sugoocheanda bea ng'eanyiida, iissa goobalooleasa nea ghwanyareas, ak ghwanung' eahuuwa fuga buwa gheang'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeyeeshi aseasa, ‘Aseasa geewooschi fuga miyaas, aseasa meawoosi fuga ghwalda gheang'da; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aseasa geewooschi damaniyeenya, was orjooga ghwaanagi; ak ea nimi orjeanagi, nea dea was ng'adaneeda ghamneawa gwandeawa bwaabwa aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiineasa siida was ng'utamiida bea ng'eanyiida, ‘Geagasayi danal gideaba goowooschi fuga miyaas: anung'unaan orjeanagi bea giyeang'wa, ak ghoayaachi booga aba jalooda gealgeagwa, ak gooweayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayeanean orjeeda giyeang'wa mwanang'; ak abeeda ghaanali gideaba moowoosi fuga buwa gheang'da goowooschi fuga miyaas, ak abeeda gaydagooneegwa orjeeda giyeang'wa, ak abeeda goopiidi ng'eang'i nea ghoabwadakti.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
